  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer, I want list rows of captured pages aliased by position, so that fixtures stay stable and carry no live data.\n\n### Scope\n- Fixture kit: a list page is aliased whole, with an independent check of the result.\n- Re-capture R10, R73a, R73b (GET only); R08-2, P03c, P03f, P03g, P03i, P03k and R121e go through the same pass.\n- Oracles and tests adapted.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `check --corpus` and the tooling tests green\n- [ ] `swift test` green",
